<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-27T19:31:41.526Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 19:31:41 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Two Coast Guard bomb experts were wounded when explosives detonated inside their Zamboanga City barracks, and two other Coast Guard members were injured in a separate blast at the same location. The Philippine Coast Guard began a five-day heightened alert for the Undas period while deploying personnel to rescue a distressed vessel in Tawi-Tawi and preparing for a large police deployment of over 72,000 personnel for the holiday. The Armed Forces of the Philippines monitored 54 Chinese vessels, including a carrier, transiting West Philippine Sea features from Oct. 20 to 26, and said the carrier passage off Mindanao was not a cause for alarm. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidkFVX3lxTE9lS3Y1dUtqdWNyZVZuZnd2ODVERW9SMUFuTlphbVNEN3V4UnBzYWpDUGd1aWhENzd5MWlYcTBoc3RGcEZhNmFPTHlUSHg1NHFNanNNX3V3cHliS05IaG4tWDdjclprNG9fcVdkRDBQRFNvN3l3VWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYkFVX3lxTE1GOEh0NlJUSnA3cDYzV3pWaHN0VGVoc1R1UHRaa01yY2NmZXlha21MMUpLTm82RDE3d0xDdmVBbjVXZkg3aDFjOGpQZ1dHWmlrbks3RnBmcktSeVpYQmFfNnVR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Global Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Philstar.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQajBTcEJFV0FkanNRaFp3ZzdiNm9PMnNXbHVuMUkwbld5bjQ3R0syNXk1dmRFb2ZVRFNfRHUxTzRYbnNUMTFpd2ZZZ3dyaVpFSTdIV1NLWVQ4S2h4RHhVbV9KN0ZKbUZjVUtuZ1pSc2VNbnVVLWFSTUVTWGxld2RaaVAwOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxPQmdYSS12SFRmOFJlbHNJLThSX3F6Zzczc2U0V1gzLU9HeTJBN1pMcU40RENEOGhWVWkteHpoYXUxdG5PQUsydy1hZWYxODlIMnNSZlUwTVktWjJFVUw0bjN3Y2tkSEFYVUVuOXVwSWM4T